    "detailed_description": "----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>--- <strong><i>The game can be played with the keyboard! Just make sure to use it from the start.</i></strong> ---<br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br>Competitive split screen 2D platformer? YES!<br>Local multiplayer or advanced artificial inteligence? You know it!<br>Elastic rope? You bet!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/62dea18f0ec5ff85038c2fe2571cae49.poster.avif?t=1696269357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/62dea18f0ec5ff85038c2fe2571cae49.webm?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/62dea18f0ec5ff85038c2fe2571cae49.mp4?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/98b3fc4509c012f1efe333b1680ea63c.poster.avif?t=1696269357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/98b3fc4509c012f1efe333b1680ea63c.webm?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/98b3fc4509c012f1efe333b1680ea63c.mp4?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/b4ffe75e596ff9e07b5e9763ba2fe9e6.poster.avif?t=1696269357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/b4ffe75e596ff9e07b5e9763ba2fe9e6.webm?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/b4ffe75e596ff9e07b5e9763ba2fe9e6.mp4?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Super Hiking League DX has been officially awarded as a showcase game in YoYoGame's Made With GameMaker!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/8d05e9c92d77b6626cf01d6a40897bf5.avif?t=1696269357\" /></div><br><br>Join Nelson and his friends in Super Hiking League DX! Race to the top against a friend or the AI in platforming races with direct combat, and an elastic hookshot.<br><br>An evil wizard is making the mountains disappear in a plan to make the world perfectly flat. As a member of the Super Hiking League you will not let this happen. Compete in climbing matches against other Hikers to collect all magic gems and stop his plans!<br><br>Super Hiking League provides tight jump-rope-bend-swing-win gameplay with beautiful 8-bit+ graphics and a top notch authentic 8-bit soundtrack!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/2dd5687e76f4fd3ab8757df9d817fcd4.avif?t=1696269357\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/7b3d32697c941b26b9b190a98fcd2dbc.avif?t=1696269357\" /></div><br><br>- Beautiful retro graphics!<br>- Tight gameplay and controls!<br>- Bending Rope Swing Physics!<br>- Amazing Soundtrack!<br>- Story mode!<br>- Time Attack mode!<br>- Challenge a friend in local multiplayer mode!",
    "about_the_game": "----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>--- <strong><i>The game can be played with the keyboard! Just make sure to use it from the start.</i></strong> ---<br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br>Competitive split screen 2D platformer? YES!<br>Local multiplayer or advanced artificial inteligence? You know it!<br>Elastic rope? You bet!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/62dea18f0ec5ff85038c2fe2571cae49.poster.avif?t=1696269357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/62dea18f0ec5ff85038c2fe2571cae49.webm?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/62dea18f0ec5ff85038c2fe2571cae49.mp4?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/98b3fc4509c012f1efe333b1680ea63c.poster.avif?t=1696269357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/98b3fc4509c012f1efe333b1680ea63c.webm?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/98b3fc4509c012f1efe333b1680ea63c.mp4?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/b4ffe75e596ff9e07b5e9763ba2fe9e6.poster.avif?t=1696269357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/b4ffe75e596ff9e07b5e9763ba2fe9e6.webm?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/b4ffe75e596ff9e07b5e9763ba2fe9e6.mp4?t=1696269357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Super Hiking League DX has been officially awarded as a showcase game in YoYoGame's Made With GameMaker!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/8d05e9c92d77b6626cf01d6a40897bf5.avif?t=1696269357\" /></div><br><br>Join Nelson and his friends in Super Hiking League DX! Race to the top against a friend or the AI in platforming races with direct combat, and an elastic hookshot.<br><br>An evil wizard is making the mountains disappear in a plan to make the world perfectly flat. As a member of the Super Hiking League you will not let this happen. Compete in climbing matches against other Hikers to collect all magic gems and stop his plans!<br><br>Super Hiking League provides tight jump-rope-bend-swing-win gameplay with beautiful 8-bit+ graphics and a top notch authentic 8-bit soundtrack!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/2dd5687e76f4fd3ab8757df9d817fcd4.avif?t=1696269357\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915850/extras/7b3d32697c941b26b9b190a98fcd2dbc.avif?t=1696269357\" /></div><br><br>- Beautiful retro graphics!<br>- Tight gameplay and controls!<br>- Bending Rope Swing Physics!<br>- Amazing Soundtrack!<br>- Story mode!<br>- Time Attack mode!<br>- Challenge a friend in local multiplayer mode!",
    "short_description": "In Super Hiking League DX your skills in 2D platformers will be put to the test against an AI like no other! Features an easy to use but hard to master elastic rope, single player mode, vs mode and time attack mode!",
